  "question": {
    "text": "The angles <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi></math> of a <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> are in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>.</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then the area (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>s</mi><mi>q</mi><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>m</mi></math>) of this triangle&nbsp;is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
